{"ID":"20251011104842-fvi1d5o","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251011104842-fvi1d5o","title":"UPL7-6——避免复杂碰撞体类型","type":"doc","updated":"20251031161119"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104842-l06k7en","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251011104842-l06k7en","updated":"20251031161119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞器性能消耗排行"}]},{"ID":"20251011104914-g84qwu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104914-g84qwu3","updated":"20251031161119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果我们将 Unity 提供给我们的自带碰撞器进行性能消耗排行，那么得到的结果是这样的（前面的消耗更低，后面的消耗更高）"}]},{"ID":"20251011104957-ha6kauq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-ha6kauq","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104957-q3d9r9q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-q3d9r9q","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104957-yep7i7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-yep7i7n","updated":"20251011105013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"球体（Sphere Collider）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105003-m7y58s3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105003-m7y58s3","updated":"20251011105006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最省性能，因为数学公式简单，适合用于子弹、角色感知范围、球类等"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011104957-wh8vj9o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-wh8vj9o","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104957-wnem1q2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-wnem1q2","updated":"20251011105022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胶囊体（Capsule Collider）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105042-d291iez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105042-d291iez","updated":"20251011105042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稍比球复杂，但依旧是数学公式计算，常用于角色、NPC 碰撞体"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011104957-t0cgbsf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-t0cgbsf","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104957-fbn26be","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-fbn26be","updated":"20251011105028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"盒体（Box Collide）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105037-hrchwo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105037-hrchwo0","updated":"20251011105038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稍微复杂一点，但仍然是矩阵与边界检测，性能非常高，场景里使用最广泛，比如地板、墙壁、方形物体"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011104957-jdser2a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-jdser2a","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104957-an7usmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-an7usmm","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组合碰撞体（由多个原始碰撞体（Sphere、Box、Capsule）拼接）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105045-0hk0qmc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105045-0hk0qmc","updated":"20251011105045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开销比单一原始体略高，但仍远低于 网格碰撞器(Mesh Collider)"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011104957-u1j92cf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-u1j92cf","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104957-702uma9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-702uma9","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"轮子碰撞体（WheelCollider）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105047-ig100ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105047-ig100ki","updated":"20251011105047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它的本质不是网格求交，主要开销来自于垂直射线检测和摩擦、扭矩、制动相关的计算"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011104957-6x6lxuf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-6x6lxuf","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104957-gxssrsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-gxssrsn","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地形碰撞体（Terrain Collider）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105050-ihbqlyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105050-ihbqlyo","updated":"20251011105057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"专门为地形系统优化的特殊碰撞器，内部使用高度图数据，而不是逐三角面，在大规模场景中比 Mesh Collider 高效很多"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011104957-1vhccye","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-1vhccye","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011104957-kngjg0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104957-kngjg0k","updated":"20251011104957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网格碰撞器（Mesh Collider）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105109-di2jivy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105109-di2jivy","updated":"20251011105109"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105108-z134xg5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105108-z134xg5","updated":"20251011105108"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105108-l9vblbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105108-l9vblbo","updated":"20251011105113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凸形碰撞器（Convex）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105114-540kz0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105114-540kz0j","updated":"20251011105119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 会把网格转为凸包，比凹形高效一些，但依旧比原始体差很多，网格碰撞器附带刚体时必须设为凸形"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105110-g8lsxwd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105110-g8lsxwd","updated":"20251011105110"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105110-l8chnx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105110-l8chnx1","updated":"20251011105112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凹形碰撞器（Non-Convex）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105123-3qtmw6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105123-3qtmw6h","updated":"20251011105129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直接对网格三角面做碰撞检测，性能最差，尤其是高多边形模型，仅适合静态物体（地形、建筑）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105133-ousva8o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105133-ousva8o","updated":"20251011105133"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105133-ao9czea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105133-ao9czea","updated":"20251011105134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"布料（Cloth）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105136-cq69ira","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105136-cq69ira","updated":"20251011105136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与传统碰撞器不同，按布料顶点数量 × 约束迭代 ×（自/外部碰撞）进行开销\n低顶点且无碰撞时成本可控，一旦开启自碰撞/与 Collider 碰撞并提高迭代数，成本迅速攀升"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251011104914-2d63h7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011104914-2d63h7d","updated":"20251011105140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们应该尽量使用消耗更低的碰撞器，可以节约性能"}]},{"ID":"20251011105152-z6g0c7l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251011105152-z6g0c7l","updated":"20251011105258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同碰撞器之间碰撞产生的消耗"}]},{"ID":"20251011105158-20evgvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105158-20evgvw","updated":"20251011105220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当两个物体发生碰撞时（排除 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"WheelCollider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Cloth"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，因为他们严格意义上属于不同的计算方式）"}]},{"ID":"20251011105203-al3l5ap","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105203-al3l5ap","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105225-aep2uum","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105225-aep2uum","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105225-ztoed75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105225-ztoed75","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相同类型的简单碰撞体（Sphere、Capsule、Box）性能消耗会更低"}]},{"ID":"20251011105226-y7u4iui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105226-y7u4iui","updated":"20251011105226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如：Sphere-Sphere, Capsule-Capsule, Box-Box"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105225-p2wfpwx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105225-p2wfpwx","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105225-uhj0we4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105225-uhj0we4","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同简单碰撞体（Sphere、Capsule、Box）性能消耗略高，但是差别并不会太大"}]},{"ID":"20251011105228-4e4p8uv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105228-4e4p8uv","updated":"20251011105228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如：Sphere-Capsule、Sphere-Box、Capsule-Box"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105225-p1olkfo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105225-p1olkfo","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105225-ci7cyv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105225-ci7cyv4","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果简单碰撞体（Sphere、Capsule、Box）和网格碰撞体（Mesh Collider）产生碰撞"}]},{"ID":"20251011105231-0r3azaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105231-0r3azaj","updated":"20251011105231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能消耗取决于网格复杂度，三角面数越多，性能消耗呈指数级增加\n比如：Sphere-Mesh Collider、Capsule-Mesh Collider、Box-Mesh Collider"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105225-mflcm58","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105225-mflcm58","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105225-onrg78s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105225-onrg78s","updated":"20251011105225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果两个网格碰撞体（Mesh Collider）产生碰撞"}]},{"ID":"20251011105233-98sg6r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105233-98sg6r0","updated":"20251011105233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能消耗取决于网格复杂度，三角面数越多，性能消耗呈指数级增加\n比如：Mesh Collider-Mesh Collider"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105158-y62jcf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105158-y62jcf9","updated":"20251011105210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在构建项目时，我们应该尽量让物体之间的碰撞器尽量简单一致，尽量不要使用网格碰撞器"}]},{"ID":"20251011105258-m1q2aka","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251011105258-m1q2aka","updated":"20251011105331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用简单的网格碰撞器"}]},{"ID":"20251011105306-xe40izy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105306-xe40izy","updated":"20251011105313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过前面的知识点我们知道，使用网格碰撞器就意味着更高的开销，因此在使用网格碰撞器时应该遵守以下规则"}]},{"ID":"20251011105309-6c2hpil","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105309-6c2hpil","updated":"20251011105324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105309-98z8fqi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105309-98z8fqi","updated":"20251011105309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105309-31wrsnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105309-31wrsnf","updated":"20251011105309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能不用就不用"}]},{"ID":"20251011105316-r7bpn1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105316-r7bpn1i","updated":"20251011105316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以用多个 Box、Sphere、Capsule 拼凑成近似轮廓"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105309-1f1q09v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105309-1f1q09v","updated":"20251011105324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105309-uz1kgbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105309-uz1kgbl","updated":"20251011105309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一定要用，先精简"}]},{"ID":"20251011105317-0ocaviz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105317-0ocaviz","updated":"20251011105324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们应该尽量将复杂网格碰撞器简化为简单网格碰撞器，并且优先设置为凸网格，一般这种精度牺牲并不会带来表现上的差别\n做法：让美术出低模网格、在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MeshCollider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中进行设置、自己写相关工具"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105331-qw3sj81","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251011105331-qw3sj81","updated":"20251011105354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免复杂的物理组件"}]},{"ID":"20251011105337-snmoeg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105337-snmoeg8","updated":"20251011105347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地形碰撞器（TerrainCollider）、布料（Cloth）、轮子碰撞器（WheelCollider），这三类组件属于 特殊用途型 组件\n它们的底层处理逻辑如刚才所说，和常规碰撞器（Sphere、Box、Capsule）完全不同\n计算量往往更大，如果项目中没有对应的需求，我们应该能不用就不用！！"}]},{"ID":"20251011105342-p0v1bt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105342-p0v1bt5","updated":"20251011105342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"什么时候使用它们："}]},{"ID":"20251011105340-lfa4ahe","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105340-lfa4ahe","updated":"20251011105354"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105340-e36pa8p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105340-e36pa8p","updated":"20251011105340"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105340-dj1h6ni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105340-dj1h6ni","updated":"20251011105340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只在使用 Unity 地形（Terrain）系统时用；普通场景地面用常规碰撞器更省"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105340-23qtzdn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105340-23qtzdn","updated":"20251011105354"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105340-wj2o9h4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105340-wj2o9h4","updated":"20251011105354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只在近景、核心表现需要真实布料（Cloth）时才启用；其他情况用动画、Shader 替代"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011105340-exby69t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251011105340-exby69t","updated":"20251011105340"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011105340-d7ovq33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011105340-d7ovq33","updated":"20251011105340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真正做车辆才用；简单小车、玩具效果用 Sphere、Raycast 就能搞定"}]}]}]}]}